From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:30:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PC5: the controller answers a game's pop-up (Wine patch 0911)

With the controller as the game's XInput controller or DualSense there
is no keyboard, so a pop-up a game shows (a minimum-specs warning, a
Yes/No question) could not be answered. Cross and the D-pad now also go
to Wine as dialog keys, Enter and the arrows: Wine's PS5 driver sends
them only while a dialog box is in front, drops them otherwise, and
always sends a key's release once it sent its press.
---
